{% comment %}
  Nepal Tea Exchange — Fonepay payment link (order status page)

  1. In Shopify Admin → Settings → Custom data → create a metafield OR
     use Shopify Flow / your app to pass signed URLs (recommended: server signs URLs).

  2. For theme-only setup, use the checkout redirect from your payment instructions
     email template with a URL built by scripts/sign-checkout-url.js or your backend.

  This snippet is a placeholder: signing must happen server-side (CHECKOUT_HMAC_SECRET).
  Do NOT put the HMAC secret in the theme.
{% endcomment %}

{% if order.financial_status == 'pending' %}
  <div class="fonepay-pay-block" style="margin:1.5rem 0;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;">
    <h3>Pay with Fonepay</h3>
    <p>Complete your payment by scanning the QR code.</p>
    <p>
      <a class="button" href="{{ shop.url }}">
        Return to store — payment link is sent by email or provided at checkout
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
{% endif %}
